          "en": "Follows night drafts only with both civilian records and guard codes."
        },
        "stress": {
          "ko": "노동조합이 부품 출고를 멈춰 순찰대가 빈 차단문만 지키다 외곽 약탈에 뚫리는 것.",
          "en": "That the labor union would stop parts releases, the patrol would hold empty barrier gates, and the outskirts would be pierced by looting."
        },
        "relationship": {
          "ko": "이강묵의 차단문 지휘를 받되 김나율의 시민권 명부를 지키는 이중 계약이고, 구찬솔의 공구 반출 봉쇄를 순찰로 받친다.",
          "en": "A double contract taking I Gangmuk's barrier-gate command while protecting Kim Nayul's citizenship roster, and backing Gu Chansol's tool-export blockade with patrols."
        },
        "effects": []
      },
